  "scope": "One disposable Kubernetes v1.36.1 Kind cluster with a control plane and a worker. Reads live component versions and compares rejected and allowed synthetic minor upgrade plans. Performs real PDB-coordinated eviction, cordon/drain and uncordon on the owned worker. A tokenless workload reports an actual fixture HTTP health code for the stable and candidate revision. An explicitly pinned workload rollback restores the stable marker and health. Then a native v1.36.1 to v1.36.6 upgrade checks both kubelets, kube-proxy, CoreDNS and the same synthetic Service. A verified post-upgrade snapshot restores deliberately modified state and the same Service on the upgraded cluster.",
